    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Re-add IDBDatabase abort event]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27167</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27167"/>
        <updated>2025-08-19T18:22:54.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=2f3b9dd03c6c4a961d44a632fe1976c73fa19e1f&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">Based on <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="1140067250" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/15006" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/15006/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/15006">#15006</a>.</p>

<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Adds the <code class="notranslate">abort</code> event on <code class="notranslate">IDBDatabase</code>.</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Motivation</h4>
<p dir="auto">The IDBDatabase abort event is defined in the spec, and implemented in Chrome, Firefox, and Safari, so the data shouldn't<br>
have been removed in the first place.</p>
<div class="markdown-alert markdown-alert-important" dir="auto"><p class="markdown-alert-title" dir="auto"><svg class="octicon octicon-report mr-2" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 1.75C0 .784.784 0 1.75 0h12.5C15.216 0 16 .784 16 1.75v9.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 14.25 13H8.06l-2.573 2.573A1.458 1.458 0 0 1 3 14.543V13H1.75A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25Zm1.75-.25a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v9.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h2a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.19l2.72-2.72a.749.749 0 0 1 .53-.22h6.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-9.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25Zm7 2.25v2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0ZM9 9a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0Z"></path></svg>Important</p><p dir="auto">While the same <a href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/15345#issuecomment-3024294352" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/15345/hovercard">may apply to 50+ events</a> that can bubble to Element, Document, and Window, we do <strong>not</strong> intend to add corresponding data to those three interfaces.</p>
</div>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
